    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36515" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰγώνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγών</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beside the mark, irrelevant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				260
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ πόρρω τοῦ σκοποῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>excluded from competition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.60
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξω τοῦ ἀγῶνος ὤν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
